doc:Factsdocument schema:abstract "Stator short-circuit faults (SSCFs) account for a significant portion of induction motor failures, yet their early detection remains a challenge in industrial environments where labeled fault data is scarce and installing additional sensors is often impractical." .
_:c7412ea93f0880a2e18e71cb5826458d rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsdocument schema:abstract "Stator short-circuit faults (SSCFs) account for a significant portion of induction motor failures, yet their early detection remains a challenge in industrial environments where labeled fault data is scarce and installing additional sensors is often impractical." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:6ff2c9bf8bfd .
doc:Factsdocument schema:abstract "By redefining fault detection as a statistical test of independence between control inputs (voltages) and current residuals, the proposed method identifies incipient faults as model drifts without relying on prior knowledge of fault distributions." .
_:c0ab0abd5715398490be8b4f5f1a8f97 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsdocument schema:abstract "By redefining fault detection as a statistical test of independence between control inputs (voltages) and current residuals, the proposed method identifies incipient faults as model drifts without relying on prior knowledge of fault distributions." )>> ;
